<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href=  "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<style>
    *{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{

background:#050505;
color:white;

}

header{

width:100%;
padding:25px 10%;

}

nav{

display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;

}

.logo{

font-size:30px;
font-weight:700;
color:#43d854;

}

nav ul{

display:flex;
list-style:none;
gap:40px;

}

nav ul li a{

text-decoration:none;
color:white;
font-size:16px;

}

button{

padding:12px 28px;
border:none;
background:#43d854;
color:white;
border-radius:8px;
cursor:pointer;

}

.hero{

width:100%;
min-height:90vh;

display:flex;

justify-content:space-between;

align-items:center;

padding:0 10%;

}

.left{

width:55%;

}

.left h1{

font-size:70px;
line-height:90px;

}

.left p{

margin:30px 0;

color:#bdbdbd;

font-size:18px;

}

.buttons{

display:flex;
gap:20px;

}

.btn{

background:#43d854;

padding:15px 30px;

border-radius:10px;

text-decoration:none;

color:white;

}

.btn2{

text-decoration:none;

color:white;

padding:15px;

}

.right{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:250px 250px;

gap:20px;

}

.card{

background:#111;

border:1px solid #1d1d1d;

border-radius:20px;

padding:25px;

}

.big{

height:280px;

}

.image{

padding:0;

overflow:hidden;

}

.image img{

width:100%;

height:100%;

object-fit:cover;

}

.small{

height:140px;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

flex-direction:column;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-10px);

transition:.4s;

border:1px solid #43d854;

}
.social-icons{
    display:flex;
    gap:15px;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.social-icons i{
    font-size:22px;
    color:#e5ede8;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:0.3s;
}

.social-icons i:hover{
    color:#d3aaaa;
    transform:scale(1.2);
}
.rating-section{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
    margin-top:40px;
}

.users{
    display:flex;
}

.users img{
    width:45px;
    height:45px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:3px solid #000;
    object-fit:cover;
    margin-left:-12px;
}

.users img:first-child{
    margin-left:0;
}

.review p{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:15px;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.stars{
    color:#19d64b;
    font-size:20px;
}

.stars span{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:18px;
    margin-left:10px;
    font-weight:600;
}
</style>
<body>
    <header>

<nav>

<h2 class="logo">CodeSpot</h2>

<ul>

<li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Services</a></li>
<li><a href="#">About</a></li>
<li><a href="#">News</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>

</ul>

<button>Get In Touch</button>

</nav>

</header>


<section class="hero">

<div class="left">

<h1>
We Create World<br>
Advancing Software<br>
With Vision And<br>
Passion
</h1>

<p>
We help build the operating system
for data-driven companies to find
and pull their performance.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<a href="#" class="btn">Get Started</a>

<a href="#" class="btn2">Learn More →</a>

</div>

</div>


<div class="right">

<div class="card big">

<h1>$500K</h1>

<p>Saved Through Resource Optimization</p>

</div>

<div class="card image">

 <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=500" alt="Profile">

</div>

<div class="card small">

<h2>10+</h2>

<p>Years of Coding</p>

</div>
<div class="social-icons">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>

<i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i>

<i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i>

<i class="fa-brands fa-facebook"></i>

<i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-section">

    <div class="users">
        <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/11.jpg" alt="">
        <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/22.jpg" alt="">
        <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/33.jpg" alt="">
        <img src="https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/men/44.jpg" alt="">
    </div>

    <div class="review">
        <p>Trusted by industry experts</p>

        <div class="stars">
            ★★★★★ <span>4.9</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>


</body>
</html>